# 技能资产目录内不得混入工作记忆（会随技能安装进用户项目）
# 2026-09-23：清掉 zh/skills/.workbuddy/ 与 zh/skills/prd/.workbuddy/ 后加，防复发
assets/*/skills/.workbuddy/
assets/*/skills/*/.workbuddy/
assets/*/skills/*/*/.workbuddy/

# assets 整个目录进 npm files，这里的任何杂项都会随包发布 —— 只放要分发的东西
# 2026-10-22：清掉 assets/.workbuddy/（内部记忆 32 个）、assets/tmp/（技能旧版 14 个）、
# evals/.work/ 与 .proto-verify.*（测试残留 14 个）后加，防复发
assets/.workbuddy/
assets/tmp/
assets/**/evals/.work/
**/.proto-verify.*

# 全局 gitignore 忽略所有 README.md，这里显式反向放行本仓需要的两份
!dashboard/docs/README.md
!/README.md


docs/releases/安装手册-Windows.pdf
